  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-03-08T07:01:22.694Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So, I've had the idea for awhile. We have this nice radial menu for doing things with our avatars, but there's no nice interface for interacting with worlds.\nWhat this is proposing is an additional menu for SDK3 worlds that can allow players to change settings in the world with their radial menu rather than inputting things from UI panels or buttons in the world. Master/Owner of the world could have their own options to adjust and so fourth.",
